# Copy to dns/.env (gitignored) and fill in real values. Never commit .env.

# API token, not the Global API Key: Cloudflare dashboard > My Profile >
# API Tokens > Create Token > Custom token, scoped to every zone listed
# under dns/zones/ (currently vantagepointfacilityservices.com.au and
# vantagepointfacilityservices.com). The built-in "Edit zone DNS" template
# is NOT enough — it grants only the first two permissions below, but
# sync-dns.mjs also syncs redirect rules via the Rulesets API, which needs
# the third:
#   Zone > Zone > Read
#   Zone > DNS > Edit
#   Zone > Single Redirect > Edit
# The script resolves each zone's ID by the `zone:` name in its own file —
# no zone ID/name env vars needed here.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
